WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Your business deserves more than another complicated advertising dashboard.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.800
Meet MAIRO. Your AI advertising team.

3
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:19.000
Start with your website, and MAIRO builds an understanding of your business.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.200
MAIRO recommends an advertising strategy

5
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:30.000
and shows you which creative ideas are worth testing first.

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.800
Review your ad concepts, customize the message,

7
00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:43.000
and turn your brand into creative that fits your goals.

8
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.800
When you're ready, connect your Meta account.

9
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.800
Review the campaign, approve your budget,

10
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:53.000
and stay in control before anything launches.

11
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Follow your results in one place.

12
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.800
Understand what's working, what needs attention,

13
00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:05.000
and what MAIRO recommends next.

14
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:13.000
You run the business. MAIRO runs the ads.
